# The Coding Chef 🍳

A recipe discovery web application built using Flask, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

The Coding Chef brings together a collection of home-style recipes ranging from breakfast dishes to vegetarian, non-vegetarian, and rice-based specialties. The project was modernized with reusable templates, responsive design, and an improved user experience.

## Live Demo

https://thecodingchef.onrender.com/

## Features

- Responsive user interface
- Recipe categories:
  - Breakfast
  - Rice
  - Vegetarian
  - Non-Vegetarian
- Expandable recipe cards
- Featured recipe section
- About Us page
- Recipe submission page
- Mobile-friendly layout

## Tech Stack

- Python
- Flask
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

