## Run Locally

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/PoojaPootula/the-coding-chef.git
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Run the application:

```bash
python app.py
```

Open:

```text
http://127.0.0.1:5000
```

